# {{ model_name }}

Self-aware morphotactic generation model trained with [Sebeni](https://seben.robotsmali.org)
(Algorithm 1: Φ / τ / LLM_Ref Distiller, then a line-13 alignment plugin).

**Intended use.** Extremely low-resource Manding (and related) morphological
generation, including **multilingual** runs (one language identity per sentence).
This is **not** a general-purpose chatbot.

**Limitations.** Completions must be valid JSON with a `tokens` list. A completion
whose JSON `lang` does not match **that row** scores 0 on R_lang. Format-invalid
batches cannot update θ. Grammar/dictionary checkpoints are **per language** and
move only when Φ′ > Φ (after the scratch first-create parse gate).

